{
  "info": {
    "name": "01 - Flujo Cash Completo (NUEVO MODELO)",
    "description": "Prueba el flujo completo de una reserva con pago en efectivo 100% usando el NUEVO MODELO DE DATOS.\n\n**Cambios en este modelo:**\n- Creación individual de huéspedes (POST /guests)\n- roomGuestAssignments: Asignación explícita de huéspedes a habitaciones\n- roomServiceAssignments: Servicios por habitación con fechas específicas\n- Campo channel obligatorio\n\n**Flujo:**\n1. Login\n2. Crear huésped principal\n3. Buscar habitaciones disponibles\n4. Calcular precio\n5. Crear reserva (cash 100%) con roomGuestAssignments\n6. Ver transiciones válidas\n7. Ver pagos\n8. Cambiar a ready_for_checkin\n9. Check-in\n10. Pending checkout\n11. Check-out\n12. Ver historial\n\n**Escenario:**\n- 1 huésped (Juan Pérez)\n- 1 habitación Individual\n- Check-in: 2025-01-15 | Check-out: 2025-01-18 (3 noches)\n- Pago: 100% cash\n- Sin servicios adicionales\n\n**Resultado esperado:**\n- Reserva creada con status = 'confirmed'\n- paid_amount = total_amount\n- Payment status = 'confirmed'",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login Recepcionista",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Token recibido\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.token).to.exist;",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"token\", jsonData.token);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{receptionistEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{receptionistPassword}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "login"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Crear Huésped Principal",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Huésped creado exitosamente\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.guest).to.exist;",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.guest.id).to.exist;",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"mainGuestId\", jsonData.guest.id);",
              "    console.log('✅ Huésped principal creado con ID:', jsonData.guest.id);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"identificationNumber\": \"15234567-8\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Juan\",\n  \"paternalLastName\": \"Pérez\",\n  \"maternalLastName\": \"González\",\n  \"email\": \"juan.perez.nuevo@test.com\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"+56912345001\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"1985-05-15\",\n  \"gender\": \"male\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/guests",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["guests"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Buscar Habitaciones Disponibles",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Habitaciones disponibles encontradas\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.availableRooms).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.availableRooms.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
              "    ",
              "    // Buscar habitación Individual (tipo 'individual')",
              "    const individualRoom = jsonData.availableRooms.find(r => r.type === 'individual');",
              "    pm.expect(individualRoom).to.exist;",
              "    ",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"roomId1\", individualRoom.id);",
              "    console.log('✅ Habitación Individual encontrada, ID:', individualRoom.id, 'Número:', individualRoom.number);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Fechas dinámicas: check-in en 5 días, check-out 3 noches después",
              "const today = new Date();",
              "const checkIn = new Date(today);",
              "checkIn.setDate(today.getDate() + 5);",
              "",
              "const checkOut = new Date(checkIn);",
              "checkOut.setDate(checkIn.getDate() + 3);",
              "",
              "pm.environment.set('checkInDate', checkIn.toISOString().split('T')[0]);",
              "pm.environment.set('checkOutDate', checkOut.toISOString().split('T')[0]);",
              "",
              "console.log('Check-in:', pm.environment.get('checkInDate'));",
              "console.log('Check-out:', pm.environment.get('checkOutDate'));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/search-availability?checkInDate={{checkInDate}}&checkOutDate={{checkOutDate}}&guests=1",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "search-availability"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "checkInDate",
              "value": "{{checkInDate}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "checkOutDate",
              "value": "{{checkOutDate}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "guests",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Calcular Precio",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Precio calculado correctamente\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.total).to.exist;",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.total).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
              "    ",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"calculatedTotal\", jsonData.total);",
              "    console.log('✅ Total a pagar:', jsonData.total);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"roomIds\": [{{roomId1}}],\n  \"services\": [],\n  \"checkInDate\": \"{{checkInDate}}\",\n  \"checkOutDate\": \"{{checkOutDate}}\",\n  \"guests\": 1\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/calculate-price",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "calculate-price"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Crear Reserva (NUEVO MODELO)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"✅ Reserva creada exitosamente\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Status debe ser 'confirmed' (pago cash 100%)\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.status).to.equal('confirmed');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ paid_amount debe ser igual al total\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    const totalAmount = jsonData.reservation.totalAmount;",
              "    const paidAmount = jsonData.reservation.paidAmount;",
              "    ",
              "    pm.expect(paidAmount).to.equal(totalAmount);",
              "    console.log('Total:', totalAmount, '| Pagado:', paidAmount);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Guardar IDs\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"reservationId\", jsonData.reservation.id);",
              "    pm.environment.set(\"reservationCode\", jsonData.reservation.code);",
              "    console.log('✅ Reserva creada, ID:', jsonData.reservation.id, 'Código:', jsonData.reservation.code);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"mainGuestId\": {{mainGuestId}},\n  \"additionalGuestIds\": [],\n  \"roomIds\": [{{roomId1}}],\n  \"roomGuestAssignments\": [\n    {\n      \"roomId\": {{roomId1}},\n      \"guestIds\": [{{mainGuestId}}]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"roomServiceAssignments\": [],\n  \"checkInDate\": \"{{checkInDate}}\",\n  \"checkOutDate\": \"{{checkOutDate}}\",\n  \"guestCount\": 1,\n  \"channel\": \"reception\",\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"cash\",\n  \"paymentAmount\": {{calculatedTotal}},\n  \"paymentType\": \"full\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Ver Transiciones Válidas",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"Transiciones disponibles desde 'confirmed'\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.currentStatus).to.equal('confirmed');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.validTransitions).to.be.an('array');",
              "    console.log('Transiciones válidas:', jsonData.validTransitions);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/valid-transitions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "valid-transitions"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Ver Pagos de la Reserva",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Debe haber 1 pago confirmado (cash)\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.payments).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.payments.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
              "    ",
              "    const cashPayment = jsonData.payments[0];",
              "    pm.expect(cashPayment.method).to.equal('cash');",
              "    pm.expect(cashPayment.status).to.equal('confirmed');",
              "    console.log('✅ Pago cash confirmado:', cashPayment.amount);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/payments",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "payments"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Cambiar a Ready for Check-in",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Status cambiado a 'ready_for_checkin'\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.currentStatus).to.equal('ready_for_checkin');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"newStatus\": \"ready_for_checkin\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/status",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "status"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Check-in",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Check-in realizado, status = 'in_progress'\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.status).to.equal('in_progress');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/check-in",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "check-in"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Cambiar a Pending Checkout",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Status cambiado a 'pending_checkout'\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.currentStatus).to.equal('pending_checkout');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"newStatus\": \"pending_checkout\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/status",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "status"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "11. Check-out",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Check-out realizado, status = 'completed'\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.status).to.equal('completed');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/check-out",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "check-out"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "12. Ver Historial de Cambios",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test(\"✅ Historial tiene múltiples cambios de estado\", function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.history).to.be.an('array');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.history.length).to.be.greaterThan(3);",
              "    console.log('Total de cambios registrados:', jsonData.history.length);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/history",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "history"]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
